{"id":"torrey:water","source":"torrey","name":"Water","slug":"water","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"One of the elements of the world — Ge 1:2.","refs":[["Gen",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Created the firmament to divide. — Ge 1:6,7.","refs":[["Gen",1,6,1,6],["Gen",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Collected into one place. — Ge 1:9.","refs":[["Gen",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Created fowls and fishes, &c from. — Ge 1:20,21.","refs":[["Gen",1,20,1,20],["Gen",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Necessary to vegetation — Ge 2:5,6; Job 14:9; Isa 1:30.","refs":[["Gen",2,5,2,5],["Gen",2,6,2,6],["Job",14,9,14,9],["Isa",1,30,1,30]]},{"text":"Some plants particularly require — Job 8:11.","refs":[["Job",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"Necessary to the comfort and happiness of man — Isa 41:17; Zec 9:11.","refs":[["Isa",41,17,41,17],["Zech",9,11,9,11]]},{"text":"Springs. — Jos 15:19.","refs":[["Josh",15,19,15,19]]},{"text":"Pools. — 1Ki 22:38; Ne 2:14.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,38,22,38],["Neh",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Ponds. — Ex 7:19; Isa 19:10.","refs":[["Exod",7,19,7,19],["Isa",19,10,19,10]]},{"text":"Fountains. — 1Ki 18:5; 2Ch 32:3.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,5,18,5],["2Chr",32,3,32,3]]},{"text":"Wells. — Ge 21:19.","refs":[["Gen",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"Brooks. — 2Sa 17:20; 1Ki 18:5.","refs":[["2Sam",17,20,17,20],["1Kgs",18,5,18,5]]},{"text":"Streams. — Ps 78:16; Isa 35:6.","refs":[["Ps",78,16,78,16],["Isa",35,6,35,6]]},{"text":"Rivers. — Isa 8:7; Jer 2:18.","refs":[["Isa",8,7,8,7],["Jer",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"The sea. — Ge 1:9,10; Isa 11:9.","refs":[["Gen",1,9,1,9],["Gen",1,10,1,10],["Isa",11,9,11,9]]},{"text":"The clouds. — Ge 1:7; Job 26:8,9.","refs":[["Gen",1,7,1,7],["Job",26,8,26,8],["Job",26,9,26,9]]},{"text":"Rises in vapour to the clouds — Ec 1:7; Ps 104:8.","refs":[["Eccl",1,7,1,7],["Ps",104,8,104,8]]},{"text":"Drops from the clouds in rain — De 11:11; 2Sa 21:10.","refs":[["Deut",11,11,11,11],["2Sam",21,10,21,10]]},{"text":"Fluid. — Ps 78:16; Pr 30:4.","refs":[["Ps",78,16,78,16],["Prov",30,4,30,4]]},{"text":"Unstable. — Ge 49:4.","refs":[["Gen",49,4,49,4]]},{"text":"Penetrating. — Ps 109:18.","refs":[["Ps",109,18,109,18]]},{"text":"Reflecting images. — Pr 27:9.","refs":[["Prov",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Wearing the hardest substances. — Job 14:19.","refs":[["Job",14,19,14,19]]},{"text":"Cleansing. — Eze 36:25; Eph 5:26.","refs":[["Ezek",36,25,36,25],["Eph",5,26,5,26]]},{"text":"Refreshing. — Job 22:7; Pr 25:25.","refs":[["Job",22,7,22,7],["Prov",25,25,25,25]]},{"text":"Congealed by cold — Job 38:29; Ps 147:16,17.","refs":[["Job",38,29,38,29],["Ps",147,16,147,16],["Ps",147,17,147,17]]},{"text":"As their principal beverage. — Ge 24:43; 1Ki 13:19,22; 18:4; Ho 2:5.","refs":[["Gen",24,43,24,43],["1Kgs",13,19,13,19],["1Kgs",13,22,13,22],["1Kgs",18,4,18,4],["Hos",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"For culinary purposes. — Ex 12:9.","refs":[["Exod",12,9,12,9]]},{"text":"For washing the person. — Ge 18:4; 24:32.","refs":[["Gen",18,4,18,4],["Gen",24,32,24,32]]},{"text":"For legal purification. — Ex 29:4; Heb 9:10,19.","refs":[["Exod",29,4,29,4],["Heb",9,10,9,10],["Heb",9,19,9,19]]},{"text":"Kept for purification in large waterpots — Joh 2:6.","refs":[["John",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Carried in vessels — Ge 21:14; 1Sa 26:11; Mr 14:13.","refs":[["Gen",21,14,21,14],["1Sam",26,11,26,11],["Mark",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Artificial mode of conveying, into large cities — 2Ki 20:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Frequently brackish and unfit for use — Ex 15:23; 2Ki 2:19.","refs":[["Exod",15,23,15,23],["2Kgs",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"The want of, considered a great calamity — Ex 17:1-3; Nu 20:2; 2Ki 3:9,10; Isa 3:1.","refs":[["Exod",17,1,17,3],["Num",20,2,20,2],["2Kgs",3,9,3,9],["2Kgs",3,10,3,10],["Isa",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"In times of scarcity, sold at an enormous price — La 5:4.","refs":[["Lam",5,4,5,4]]},{"text":"Turned into blood. — Ex 7:17,20.","refs":[["Exod",7,17,7,17],["Exod",7,20,7,20]]},{"text":"Turned into wine. — Joh 2:7-9.","refs":[["John",2,7,2,9]]},{"text":"Brought from the rock. — Ex 17:6; Nu 20:11.","refs":[["E