","refs":[["Hos",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"(Poured out,) of faintness by terror. — Ps 22:14.","refs":[["Ps",22,14,22,14]]},{"text":"(Pouring, out of buckets,) of a numerous progeny. — Nu 24:7.","refs":[["Num",24,7,24,7]]},{"text":"(Spilled on the ground,) of death. — 2Sa 14:14.","refs":[["2Sam",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"(Its instability,) of a wavering disposition. — Ge 49:4.","refs":[["Gen",49,4,49,4]]},{"text":"(Its weakness,) of faintness and cowardice. — Jos 7:5; Eze 7:17.","refs":[["Josh",7,5,7,5],["Ezek",7,17,7,17]]},{"text":"(Difficulty of stopping,) of strife and contention. — Pr 17:14.","refs":[["Prov",17,14,17,14]]},{"text":"(Rapidly flowing away,) of the career of the wicked. — Job 24:18; Ps 58:7.","refs":[["Job",24,18,24,18],["Ps",58,7,58,7]]},{"text":"(Many,) of different nations and people. — Re 17:1,15; Jer 51:13.","refs":[["Rev",17,1,17,1],["Rev",17,15,17,15],["Jer",51,13,51,13]]},{"text":"(Many,) of a variety of afflictions. — 2Sa 22:17.","refs":[["2Sam",22,17,22,17]]},{"text":"(Noise of many,) of the word of Christ. — Re 1:15.","refs":[["Rev",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"(Covering the sea,) of the general diffusion of the knowledge of God. — Isa 11:9; Hab 2:14.","refs":[["Isa",11,9,11,9],["Hab",2,14,2,14]]}],"refCount":131}
